# Security and privacy headers for Cloudflare Pages build output.
# Applied to all requests (spec 0001, AC-3 — no cookies, no tracking).
#
# _headers is a Cloudflare Pages convention.  Astro copies files from
# public/ to dist/ at build time, so this file ends up at dist/_headers
# in the deployment.
#
# Do NOT add Cache-Control: max-age here — the service worker
# (sw.js) manages caching per its strategy.  Static HTML pages should
# be served fresh so visitors get new content on each deploy.

# Everything
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()

